UID:10082532-1788615000-1788625800@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:3/4 Strange
DESCRIPTION:3/4 Strange is a party rock trio playing hits from the 60s – 2000s. You will want to sing along with every song. Join us as we regale you with tunes between stops at Asheville’s best breweries. \nFender Bender is Asheville’s most unsophisticated brewery tour. We hand-pick the best local bands and take you to three amazing breweries where you and your friends can grab a pint and enjoy the region’s best local suds. Details & Tickets \n  \nLaZoom Comedy Bus Tours in Asheville – The Greatest Show on Wheels! \nOne of Asheville’s most unforgettable things to do\, LaZoom’s award-winning comedy bus tours turn the city into a hilarious\, interactive show. LaZoom’s award-winning Asheville bus tours turn the city into a rolling comedy adventure — big laughs\, bold personalities\, and the kind of shared experience that turns a “nice trip” into something legendary. You won’t just see Asheville. You’ll feel it. Make your Asheville trip unforgettable. For 20 years\, our professional performers have combined costumes\, scripted sketches\, soundscapes\, lighting\, and real local history to turn sightseeing into a high-energy\, laugh-out-loud experience through Asheville’s Downtown\, Montford\, River Arts District\, and South Slope. lazoomtours.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/3-4-strange-2/2026-09-05/1/
LOCATION:LaZoom Fender Bender: Band & Beer Bus\, 76 Biltmore Avenue\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
GEO:35.5922353;-82.5506031
